    "yusuf said his loud trumpet would be the concert's best part. amal practiced a quiet harp tune each day. yusuf played well, but amal's gentle music held everyone still. he asked her how soft music could have such power": "/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/yusuf-said-his-loud-trumpet-would-be-the-concert-s-best-part-amal-practice-1bf319986b.mp3",
